name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q15_2025'

question 'A student uses an AI assistant to help fix an error in their game code. The AI suggests a solution, but when they test it, the game still doesn\'t work as expected. What\'s the best next step for the student?'

wrong 'Copy and paste the AI\'s suggestion again until it works.'
right 'Read the AI\'s code carefully, test it step by step, and look for where the logic breaks.'
wrong 'Delete the project and start completely over from scratch.'
wrong 'Ask a classmate to fix it without checking what the AI suggested.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 2-6
